# FindLibTEX
# -----------
# Find the LibTex library
#
#  find_package(LibTEX [<version>] REQUIRED)
#
#    - TEX_FOUND        - True if the library was found.
#    - TEX_VERSION      - The version of the library.
#    - TEX_INCLUDE_DIRS - The include directories for the library.
#    - TEX_LIBRARIES    - The libraries to link against.
#]=======================================================================]